  "readme": "## README.md\n# National Geographic Database - Boundaries Collection in Geoparquet\r\n\r\nThis is a trial version of Ordnance Survey's National Geographic Database Boundaries data in GeoParquet intended for the purposes of standards development. \r\n\r\nPlease be aware that this trial data will not be maintained.\r\n\r\n## License\r\n\r\nThis data is made available under the Open Government Licence 3.0 - https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3\r\n\r\n## Documentation and feedback\r\n\r\nFurther documentation about the National Geographic Database is available at https://osngd.gitbook.io/osngd/\r\n\r\nTo provide feedback on this dataset please email futuregeo@os.uk",
